    ],
    "text": "NIMAL SIRIPALA DE SILVA (M. P.), Minister of Transport and Civil Aviation.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      431.41,
      211.7,
      481.48
    ],
    "text": "Ministry of Transport and Civil Aviation,Sethsiripaya Stage II,Battaramulla,20th June 2016.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      267.09,
      496.33,
      320.49,
      507.4
    ],
    "text": "Regulations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      82.05,
      522.37,
      539.89,
      559.48
    ],
    "text": "1.These regulations may be cited as the charges applicable for the usage of all aerodromes in Sri Lanka exceptBandaranaike International Airport (BIA), Mattala Rajapaksa International Airport (MRIA) and Ratmalana Air-port (RMA) and shall come into effect on 01st of July.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      82.05,
      574.33,
      539.86,
      598.48
    ],
    "text": "2.These Regulations shall amend the Regulations published in the Extraordinary Gazette NotificationNo. 1262/5 dated 12th November 2002.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      82.05,
      613.33,
      539.83,
      637.48
    ],
    "text": "3.Every aircraft except those operated by the Armed Forces of Sri Lanka shall pay charges mentioned in para-graph 6 here-under whenever applicable.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      82.05,
      652.33,
      540.02,
      689.44
    ],
    "text": "4.Notwithstanding the provisions of paragraph 3 above, aircraft operated by the Armed Forces and aircraft in theuse of the Government of Sri Lanka, where such aircraft are engaged in the carriage of passengers and cargofor hire or for reward shall pay charges mentioned in paragraph 6 whenever applicable.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      518.85,
      750.13,
      530.85,
      761.2
    ],
    "text": "1A",
