    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      108.91,
      167.29,
      204.32,
      178.36
    ],
    "text": "6.1Landing Charges :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      194.83,
      193.33,
      486.9,
      204.4
    ],
    "text": "Weight of A/CNew Landing Charges",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.11,
      219.25,
      428.11,
      230.32
    ],
    "text": "Upto 10,000 KgRs. 200.00 per 1,000 kg",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.11,
      245.29,
      504.91,
      269.32
    ],
    "text": "10,000 Kg to 20,000 KgRs. 2,000.00 plus Rs. 300.00 per 1,000 Kgin excess of 10,000 Kg",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.11,
      284.29,
      489.29,
      308.32
    ],
    "text": "Over 20,000 KgRs. 5,000.00 plus 500.00 per 1,000 Kgin excess of 20,000 Kg",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.11,
      323.29,
      449.88,
      334.36
    ],
    "text": "* All training flights shall be charged fifty per centum (50%) of above rates",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      108.91,
      349.33,
      206.11,
      360.4
    ],
    "text": "6.2Housing Charges :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      131.11,
      375.25,
      548.22,
      399.4
    ],
    "text": "Fifty per centum (50%) of the landing charge for each complete period of twenty four (24) hours andpart thereof.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      108.91,
      414.25,
      203.12,
      425.32
    ],
    "text": "6.3Parking Charges :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      131.11,
      440.29,
      548.15,
      464.32
    ],
    "text": "Ten per centum (10%) of the Landing Charges for each period of three (03) hours or part thereof, inexcess of the first three (03) hours of parking.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      131.11,
      479.29,
      156.31,
      490.36
    ],
    "text": "Note :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.51,
      505.33,
      548.19,
      529.36
    ],
    "text": "i)For calculting free parking period, irrespective of actual time taken, a standard time of 15 minuesof taxing from parking shed to take-off point shall be added.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      136.51,
      544.33,
      548.32,
      568.36
    ],
    "text": "ii)For calculating chargeable parking time, part of an hour should be rounded off to the nearest hour.Charges of each period of parking are also rounded off to nearest Rupee.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      133.51,
      583.33,
      465.96,
      594.4
    ],
    "text": "iii)Landing Charges for Cargo Operations are same as for Passenger Operation.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      135.31,
      609.25,
      548.14,
      633.4
    ],
    "text": "iv)In all cases, total weight of the aircraft is calculated to the nearest thousand Kg and charges to berounded off to the nearest Rupee.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      108.91,
      648.25,
      207.93,
      659.32
    ],
    "text": "6.4Terminal Charges :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      131.11,
      674.29,
      338.72,
      685.36
    ],
    "text": "Five (5%) per centum of the landing charges levied",
